file crates/gui/src/work.rs
symbol poll_reindex
lines 0 16
hash 8874bd5d2ad01fab
note Run from the top of every frame like poll_disk: when the rebuild's Job has an index, this is the frame that swaps it in. The whole cost of a re-index lands here - the carry-over, the re-resolve and the re-render - and it is one frame, not the whole rebuild. Search hits are dropped because their file and line numbers no longer mean anything, the watcher gets the new stamps so it starts looking again, and whatever changed is sent to the servers. A rebuild thread that panicked leaves the old index in use, the status says so, and the watcher is handed its old stamps again.

